    "Queue messages on your computer so they continue after you close byot. Prompts and attachments are encrypted before they pass through the BYOT relay. Your computer must stay awake and the companion must keep running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将消息排入电脑上的队列，这样在你关闭 byot 后它们也会继续运行。提示词和附件在经过 BYOT 中继之前会被加密。你的电脑必须保持唤醒，且配套程序必须持续运行。"
          }
